            "paragraph": "The T\u00e9mez model was selected and forced using precipitation and PET data as input variables to obtain hydrological components, including soil moisture, evapotranspiration, direct runoff, infiltration, and base flow. Despite its conceptual simplicity, this model has proven accurate for modelling Mediterranean basins (Marcos-Garc\u00eda 2019; P\u00e9rez-S\u00e1nchez et al. 2019; Pulido-Velazquez et al. 2005). Still, its suitability for the case study was assessed based on the multi-step criteria proposed by Krysanova et al. (2018) (See Supplementary Material).",
